    // ============================================================
    // GENERATED REPORT VIEW — SAME LIVE PREVIEW ENGINE AS TEST LAB
    // ============================================================
    // Manual/Hybrid never changes to Auto and never clones/re-parents the preview.
    // We simply hide the Manual Workstation temporarily, reveal the existing live
